      "created_at": "2017-10-13T06:12:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello.&nbsp;</p><p>This isn't a bug, the rules say if all villains (characters, I am not talking about any villain targets) are defeated you win the game.&nbsp;</p><p>Therefore I always try to beat Ambuscade at last as his incap ability won't activate and the game will be won.&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: Typo</p>",
